ay_title":"读史方舆纪要/二、西安府下（卷五十四）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"《史记》：商君反死彤地。即此。胡氏曰：在京兆郑县界]。","context_before":"...城。相传光武征隗嚣，曾驻于此。○彤城，在州西南周彤伯国。","source_end_index":160,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"52729bdd-2d04-5172-a52c-f7b28cdfcb51","source_start_index":150,"source_text":"战国时，秦魏遇于彤。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/二、西安府下（卷五十四）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事"],"content":"2秦、魏遇于彤。","content_fanyi":"秦军与魏军在彤邑相遇。","content_jianti_auto":"2秦、魏遇于彤。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":154,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c2df1a6-db0e-11ef-bf71-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"趙成侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"赵成侯","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"8c2df1b5-db0e-11ef-9d5c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"敬侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"敬侯","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"8c2df1b6-db0e-11ef-99cc-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"種","people_name_jianti_auto":"种","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"8c2df1b7-db0e-11ef-9f20-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"肅侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"肃侯","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"8c2df1b8-db0e-11ef-b96f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"語","people_name_jianti_auto":"语","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"8c2df1b9-db0e-11ef-abe5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"緤，私列翻。趙成侯，敬侯之子，名種。太子，肅侯語也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"𫄬，私列翻。赵成侯，敬侯之子，名种。太子，肃侯语也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"8c2df1b4-db0e-11ef-baac-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"趙成侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"赵成侯","people_xingming":"種","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c2df1ba-db0e-11ef-8478-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[種]